        "small, dry, and slow to pass"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Protein Shakes",
      "char_file": "웨이프로틴쉐이크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A scoop of whey protein",
        "has almost no fiber",
        "",
        "Digesting it makes your kidneys",
        "use extra water to flush waste"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Protein Shakes — try this instead",
      "char_file": "웨이프로틴쉐이크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Add chia seeds and",
        "extra water to your shake",
        "",
        "for fiber and hydration"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Iron Pills",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Common for anemia or pregnancy,",
        "but your gut only absorbs",
        "part of each dose",
        "",
        "The rest irritates your intestines",
        "and slows digestion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Iron Pills — try this instead",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Take iron with vitamin C",
